w: And won- der how He could love me, A sin- ner, con- demn'd, un- clean.
w: He had no tears for His own griefs, But sweat drops of blood for mine.
w: To com- fort Him in the sor- rows, He bore for my soul that night.
w: 'Twill be my joy thro' the a- ges, To sing of His love for me.
